              id: 3465,
              buzz_id: null,
              aspect_ratio: "1:1",
              description:
                'If you’re someone who’s trying to cut out meat or just wants a meatless evening, you’ve come to the right place! Make your family a big, hearty <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/fajita-pasta-bake">Fajita Pasta Bake</a>. Bake up some <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/buffalo-cauliflower">buffalo cauliflower</a> and serve them with a dip, in tacos, or even on pizza! Even a meat lover will love these recipes!',
