      description:
        'Despite so many options, classic penne is always a great choice when it comes to pasta. It’s easy to cook, delicious, and pairs well with almost any sauce. <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/creamy-chicken-penne-pasta">Creamy Chicken Penne Pasta</a> will always satisfy, or try the <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/fajita-pasta-bake">Fajita Pasta Bake</a> for a creative twist. Add as many or as few veggies as you want and you’re good to go!',
      created_at: 1676829896,
      thumbnail_url:
        "https://img.buzzfeed.com/thumbnailer-prod-us-east-1/video-api/assets/427961.jpg",
