              keywords: null,
              created_at: 1632947236,
              description:
                'There are not many ingredients more versatile than rice. Serve some <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/beef-broccoli-stuffed-rice-triangles">beef and broccoli-stuffed rice triangles</a> as an appetizer or think outside the box with our loaded, <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/sushi-rice-dip">one-of-a-kind sushi rice dip</a>. Finally, comfort yourself on a weeknight with our quick and homely <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/one-pot-enchilada-rice">one-pot enchilada rice</a>. When you have rice on hand, the possibilities are endless.',
              video_url: "https://vid.tasty.co/output/217633/hls24_1632947714.m3u8",
