              description:
                'We LOVE cheese (who doesn\'t?) and we know you do too, so we\'ve rounded up some recipes that\'ll celebrate that cheese adoration. Use your Hot Cheetos and make yourself a delicious <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/hot-cheeto-burrito">Hot Cheeto Burrito</a>, oozing with cheese. Stuff the cheese in some <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/loaded-cheesy-mashed-potato-balls">mashed potatoes</a>, fry it, and watch the lovely pull you\'ll get, or go the classic route and add a lot of it to your <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/caprese-mac-n-cheese">mac and cheese</a>. The possibilities are endless and dang, are they cheesi-licious.',
