              description:
                'We love experimenting with classics like mac and cheese. Not convinced? Give our <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/butter-chicken-mac-n-cheese">butter chicken mac and cheese</a> a whirl, or keep it classically Southern with a good ol\' <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/chili-mac-n-cheese">chili mac</a>. You can also dig into a cheesy bowl of mac without the carbs with our <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/5-ingredient-cauliflower-mac-n-cheese">5-ingredient cauliflower mac n cheese</a>. It\'s time to outgrow the box mac n\' cheese already! (Sorry, Kraft!) ',
