                'Do you want to make your favorite pizza into something even better? We\'ve got you covered. Start with the scrumptious <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/pizza-puff-pastry-twists">pizza puff pastry twist</a> or transform vegetables into pizza like in a <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/cheesy-eggplant-pizza">cheesy eggplant pizza</a>. It\'s impossible not to love pizza night — and when the end result is faster, cheaper, and tastier than delivery, you know you can\'t go wrong',
