              description:
                'Scoooooooby-Dooby Doo! Wow, it\'s been a long time since we\'ve said THAT, hasn\'t it? But we haven\'t forgotten our Scooby snacks. Get ready for a Scooby Doo marathon with some of our recipes that Shaggy would approve of. Whether it\'s an <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/pizza-margherita">extra cheesy pizza margharita</a>, a <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/4-flavor-sandwich-ring">4-flavor sandwich ring</a>, or the <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/the-best-chewy-chocolate-chip-cookies">chewiest of chocolate cookies</a>, we got your Scooby-inspired snacks figured out.',
              name: "Foods From Scooby Doo Every 90s Kid Will Love ",
