              beauty_url: null,
              aspect_ratio: "1:1",
              is_shoppable: false,
              description:
                'Are you team Chicken or Turkey? Can\'t decide? Well, who said you can\'t have them both? These mouth-watering recipes strike the perfect balance. Add a chicken touch to your lunch menu with our <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/slow-cooker-buffalo-chicken-chili">Slow Cooker Buffalo Chicken Chili</a>. Then, for dinner, try a Thanksgiving-worthy <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/turkey-roulade">Turkey Roulade</a>. Bring on the birds! ',
