                'Do you love rice but are bored of eating it in the same way? Try cooking up some <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/homemade-chicken-tikka-masala">Chicken Tikka Masala</a> to go with some fragrant jasmine rice. Or make some <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/kenyan-beef-and-potato-pilau-as-made-by-kiano-moju">Kenyan Beef and Potato Pilau</a> for something more decadent. For a tasty weeknight meal, dive into a hearty bowl of <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/chinese-chicken-fried-rice">Chinese Chicken Fried Rice</a>. Always rice, ever so nice.',
