              description:
                'Nothing says soul-soothing like a gourmet meal! So, why not satisfy your soul every night with our week-long array of gourmet dinner recipes? Having a slow, lazy Wednesday? Kick those hump-day blues with our <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/french-pepper-steak-steak-au-poivre">French-inspired chicken</a> with wine. And don\'t forget to ring in your Sunday night with scrumptious <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/stuffed-steak-rolls">stuffed steak rolls</a>! Put on your aprons & get ready for a week of gourmet eats.',
