              slug: "korean-inspired-food",
              promotion: "full",
              description:
                'Are you craving Korean cuisine for dinner? Then these recipes will leave you more than satisfied. Kick it off with classic <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/korean-style-bbq-pork-ribs">Korean-style BBQ Pork Ribs</a> before moving on to some delicious <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/chicken-bibimbap">Chicken Bibimbap</a>. If you’ve never made Korean food at home before, this is a super approachable menu to start with. Let’s get cooking!',
