              slug: "steak-vs-pork",
              description:
                'The two champions of meat, steak and pork, reign supreme in flavor and the possibilities with what you can do with them. Get inspired by Asia and experiment with <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/spicy-korean-bbq-style-pork">Korean-style BBQ pork</a> or even some succulent <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/korean-style-bbq-beef">BBQ beef</a>.  Looking for something quick and easy? Our <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/easy-flap-steak">easy flap steak</a> or some <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/easy-glazed-pork-chops">glazed pork chops</a> should be you go-to recipes. So steak or pork, we won\'t judge - just take your pick, and get cookin\'!',
