              id: 2341,
              beauty_url: null,
              description:
                'It\'s Taurus season - our favorite time of year! Our comforting <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/bbq-popcorn-chicken">BBQ Chicken Popcorn</a> recipe is perfect for you. The <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/gin-negroni">Gin Negroni</a> only accentuates the Taurus\' classy and sophisticated side. We recommend you pair it with a <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/honey-soy-glazed-salmon">Honey Soy Glazed Salmon</a> for the perfect sensuous date night with your loved one. Let\'s face it, Tauruses get the best eats anyways.',
